--  All Right Reserved.
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
--   ____  ____
--  /   /\/   /
-- /___/  \  /     Vendor      : Xilinx 
-- \   \   \/      Version     : 2019.2
--  \   \          Description : Xilinx Functional Simulation Library Component
--  /   /                        Clock Buffer Driven by Gigabit Transceiver
